ription":"Issues closed and untouched for a long time, together with being locked for discussion"}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syncthing/syncthing/milestones/20","html_url":"https://github.com/syncthing/syncthing/milestone/20","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syncthing/syncthing/milestones/20/labels","id":3122174,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lMzEyMjE3NA==","number":20,"title":"v0.14.46","description":null,"creator":{"login":"calmh","id":125426,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNTQyNg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125426?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/calmh","html_url":"https://github.com/calmh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calmh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calmh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calmh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calmh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calmh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calmh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calmh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calmh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calmh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":11,"state":"closed","created_at":"2018-02-16T14:21:09Z","updated_at":"2018-04-04T13:54:10Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2018-04-04T13:54:10Z"},"comments":12,"created_at":"2017-12-06T11:04:50Z","updated_at":"2019-02-26T07:02:47Z","closed_at":"2018-02-25T08:28:00Z","author_association":"MEMBER","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Repro:\r\n\r\n1. Create `dir/file` and make sure they are synced between devices A and B.\r\n2. Change ownership/permission for `dir` on device A such that the user syncthing is running as is no longer able to access `dir` (e.g. `sudo chown root:root dir && sudo chmod 700 dir`).\r\n3. Hit the rescan button on device A and wait for \"changes\" to propagate to B.\r\n\r\nResult: `dir/file` gets deleted from device B.\r\n\r\nExpected: Some kind of error or at least \"nothing\" (see #4480), but certainly not deletion of the file on the remote.\r\n\r\nOrigin of bug:  \r\nLstat returning any error is considered equal to file having been deleted: https://github.com/syncthing/syncthing/blob/master/lib/model/model.go#L1989\r\n\r\nPossible solutions:  \r\nMaybe this can be handled with stricter checking of the error returned by Lstat. If we do this, I believe we need to add `IsNotExist(err) bool` to the filesystem interface to make sure all filesystem implementations are compatible with this check.  \r\nThe following idea doesn't actually work (we also detect \"ordinary\" deletes this way).<strike>It might be both more consistent and performant to drop these lstat checks and replace them by comparing the new file info with the one it has replaced. Thus cases like replacing a dir with a file can still be detected and handled, while the case described here wont result in data loss.</strike>  \r\nAnother possibility would be to implement #4480 and skip the current lstat tests on paths that failed to be scanned.","closed_by":{"login":"calmh","id":125426,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNTQyNg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125426?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/calmh","html_url":"https://github.com/calmh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calmh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calmh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calmh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calmh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calmh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calmh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calmh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calmh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calmh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syncthing/syncthing/issues/4573/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syncthing/syncthing/issues/4573/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}